}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Paresseux mais en bonne sant\u00e9,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Je choisis de vivre \u00e0 ma mani\u00e8re."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Dans ce monde o\u00f9 tout est pr\u00e9cipit\u00e9,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re une vie plus l\u00e9g\u00e8re."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}